  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Please add support for the Baybayin Unicode block (U+1700–U+171F). Right now, Baybayin chars just show up as tofu □, making the script unusable. I'd really love to use Baybayin in my bio and chat, and I know plenty of language nerds who’d love to see more writing systems supported in-game. I'm also friends with some Filipinos who'd be really happy to finally see Baybayin properly supported, especially since some native speakers aren't even aware that the script exists — having it supported in VRC could help raise awareness of it too, so please consider adding it!\n\nPlease don't let the current lack of support be another reason for Baybayin, a script that has historically been pushed aside by colonialism, to remain overlooked🙏�",
